":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/04/himeka0043.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくて\nひめたん小吉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばんリアクションに困る結果ですよね。可もなく不可もなく。\nうん\n今年も頑張ろーう!おー(ω)/!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけでひめたんのお正月エピソードはもうちょっと続きますよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元家はまた今年も「夢叶う矢」てのを買ったんだって!\n去年はぴんくで、今年はゴールド(//ω//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/04/himeka0041.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、矢を買うときにね、ほんとは去年の矢を返さなきゃなんだけど\nおうちに忘れてきちゃったらしいのよー。\nだから来年２本返すことにしますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初夢何か見ましたか～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー覚えてない('・ω・`)\nしかもその日年賀状書いとってあんま寝とらん...\nうー来年こそは富士・鷹・なすび!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月といえばお年玉、ひめたんはもらったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}